      "size": "m",
      "text": "Press Play on any screen to use it.\n\nEvery launch opens on the desert sky. Swipe up (or tap the arrow):\n• first time (1) → your name (2) → the chat (3)\n• profile already set up (5) → straight into the chat (3)\n\nIn the chat, the menu button opens the side menu (6): Home takes you back to the desert, plus all your conversations and your profile (7).\n\nThe send button never shrinks; on narrow phones or large text the tone label folds away first.\n\nOn this canvas Orbit 412 carries a few prepared answers; in the app it answers anything you ask."
